      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-prot">Protracted path (58%):</strong> Current state holds — partial US strike pause, no direct US-Iran channel (F3 at 10%), Hormuz at ~10 transits/day (F4 at 8%), WG session produces ambiguous language insufficient to meet F9 or F8 resolution criteria.</p>
      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-desc">De-escalation path (29%):</strong> WG session produces a named-fee or governance-body element meeting F9 (18%) or F8 (20%) criteria, enabling phased commercial resumption; Araghchi's four-condition block softens through back-channel, reopening the F3 (10%) pathway toward a formal session.</p>
